---
description: Feature/package type definition conventions aligned with shared DB types
globs:
  - 'apps/*/src/features/**/types/**/*.ts'
  - 'packages/*/src/types/**/*.ts'
alwaysApply: false
---

# Type Definitions

- Colocate in `features/*/types/`; export public types from feature `index.ts`
- Prefer generated DB types from `@altitutor/shared` as source of truth; map to domain/UI types at boundaries
- Zod schemas next to forms/validations; `type X = z.infer<typeof XSchema>` when runtime validation is needed
- Discriminated unions for variant state; no `any`
